  "description": "Wonhyo, the great magician who saved the world. It has been a full ten years since he went missing. Ara, who had always looked up to Wonhyo, encounters him now transformed into a drunken vagabond. What could have happened to Wonhyo over the past ten years? Will Wonhyo truly be able to rise again as the great magician he once was?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
